[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MachineSpecies" format=3]
; The Lamplighter (FollowerBehavior): once it has seen the player it follows them through the room
; at a respectful distance, behind and above, arcing over their head to change sides and darting
; back when approached. It never attacks.

